{"slug":"n-k-r","ar":"ن ك ر","total":37,"core":"denying; not knowing; evil","forms":[{"ar":"مُنكَر","kind":"passive participle","form":4,"count":18,"gloss":"What is wrong, evil (forbidden)","word":"munkar","ex":{"s":15,"a":62,"p":4,"ar":["قَالَ","إِنَّكُمْ","قَوْمٌ","مُّنكَرُونَ"],"en":"He said, \"Indeed, you are people unknown"}},{"ar":"نَكِير","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"rejection, disapproval","word":null,"ex":{"s":35,"a":26,"p":7,"ar":["ثُمَّ","أَخَذْتُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟ ۖ","فَكَيْفَ","كَانَ","نَكِيرِ"],"en":"Then I seized the ones who disbelieved, and how [terrible] was My reproach"}},{"ar":"مُنكِرُون","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"deniers; not recognizing","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":50,"p":7,"ar":["وَهَـٰذَا","ذِكْرٌ","مُّبَارَكٌ","أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ ۚ","أَفَأَنتُمْ","لَهُۥ","مُنكِرُونَ"],"en":"And this [Qur'an] is a blessed message which We have sent down. Then are you with it unacquainted"}},{"ar":"نُّكْر","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"terrible, evil","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":87,"p":13,"ar":["قَالَ","أَمَّا","مَن","ظَلَمَ","فَسَوْفَ","نُعَذِّبُهُۥ","ثُمَّ","يُرَدُّ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّهِۦ","فَيُعَذِّبُهُۥ","عَذَابًا","نُّكْرًا"],"en":"He said, \"As for one who wrongs, we will punish him. Then he will be returned to his Lord, and He will punish him with a terrible punishment"}},{"ar":"يُنكِرُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":3,"gloss":"to deny","word":null,"ex":{"s":40,"a":81,"p":6,"ar":["وَيُرِيكُمْ","ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","فَأَىَّ","ءَايَـٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","تُنكِرُونَ"],"en":"And He shows you His signs. So which of the signs of Allah do you deny"}},{"ar":"أَنكَر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"harshest, most disagreeable","word":null,"ex":{"s":31,"a":19,"p":8,"ar":["وَٱقْصِدْ","فِى","مَشْيِكَ","وَٱغْضُضْ","مِن","صَوْتِكَ ۚ","إِنَّ","أَنكَرَ","ٱلْأَصْوَٰتِ","لَصَوْتُ","ٱلْحَمِيرِ"],"en":"And be moderate in your pace and lower your voice; indeed, the most disagreeable of sounds is the voice of donkeys"}},{"ar":"مُّنكِرَة","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"denying, refusing","word":null,"ex":{"s":16,"a":22,"p":9,"ar":["إِلَـٰهُكُمْ","إِلَـٰهٌ","وَٰحِدٌ ۚ","فَٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يُؤْمِنُونَ","بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","قُلُوبُهُم","مُّنكِرَةٌ","وَهُم","مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ"],"en":"Your god is one God. But those who do not believe in the Hereafter - their hearts are disapproving, and they are arrogant"}},{"ar":"نَكِرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to find strange","word":null,"ex":{"s":11,"a":70,"p":7,"ar":["فَلَمَّا","رَءَآ","أَيْدِيَهُمْ","لَا","تَصِلُ","إِلَيْهِ","نَكِرَهُمْ","وَأَوْجَسَ","مِنْهُمْ","خِيفَةً ۚ","قَالُوا۟","لَا","تَخَفْ","إِنَّآ","أُرْسِلْنَآ","إِلَىٰ","قَوْمِ","لُوطٍ"],"en":"But when he saw their hands not reaching for it, he distrusted them and felt from them apprehension. They said, \"Fear not. We have been sent to the people of Lot"}},{"ar":"نَكِّرُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":1,"gloss":"to disguise","word":null,"ex":{"s":27,"a":41,"p":2,"ar":["قَالَ","نَكِّرُوا۟","لَهَا","عَرْشَهَا","نَنظُرْ","أَتَهْتَدِىٓ","أَمْ","تَكُونُ","مِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَهْتَدُونَ"],"en":"He said, \"Disguise for her her throne; we will see whether she will be guided [to truth] or will be of those who is not guided"}},{"ar":"نَّكِير","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"denial","word":null,"ex":{"s":42,"a":47,"p":21,"ar":["ٱسْتَجِيبُوا۟","لِرَبِّكُم","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَأْتِىَ","يَوْمٌ","لَّا","مَرَدَّ","لَهُۥ","مِنَ","ٱللَّهِ ۚ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّن","مَّلْجَإٍ","يَوْمَئِذٍ","وَمَا","لَكُم","مِّن","نَّكِيرٍ"],"en":"Respond to your Lord before a Day comes from Allah of which there is no repelling. No refuge will you have that day, nor for you will there be any denial"}},{"ar":"نُّكُر","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"terrible","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":6,"p":8,"ar":["فَتَوَلَّ","عَنْهُمْ ۘ","يَوْمَ","يَدْعُ","ٱلدَّاعِ","إِلَىٰ","شَىْءٍ","نُّكُرٍ"],"en":"So leave them, [O Muhammad]. The Day the Caller calls to something forbidding"}}],"surahs":[[3,3],[9,3],[16,3],[22,3],[18,2],[29,2],[31,2],[5,1],[7,1],[11,1],[12,1],[13,1],[15,1],[21,1],[23,1],[24,1],[27,1],[34,1],[35,1],[40,1],[42,1],[51,1],[54,1],[58,1],[65,1],[67,1]]}